  "description": "ACT-RETAIN: a second Workspace (CreateWorkspace 'rqwws', not appended) opens the scratch database and a snapshot; Workspace.Close is called while both are held. Reads afterwards: Workspace Name, Database Name, recordset EOF and a Field Value, then Recordset.Close and Database.Close.",
